@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Class Diagram - UC-76 Cancel Paid Order and Request Refund

class "Checkout / Payment UI" as UI <<boundary>>
class "PaymentController" as Controller <<controller>>
class "PaymentService" as Service <<service>>
class "Bill" as Bill <<domain>>
class "ShoeDetail" as ShoeDetail <<domain>>
class "Coupon" as Coupon <<domain>>
class "OrderEmailService" as OrderEmailService <<domain>>

UI --> Controller : POST /payments/orders/:orderCode/cancel-refund
Controller --> Service : delegates
Service --> Bill : uses
Service --> ShoeDetail : uses
Service --> Coupon : uses
Service --> OrderEmailService : uses
Service --> "Stripe Gateway" : integrates
Service --> "Gmail SMTP" : email notification

note right of UI
UC-76 - Cancel Paid Order and Request Refund
Actors: Guest, User, Stripe Gateway, System
Pre: Order is PAID and fulfillment status is CONFIRMED or PACKING
Post: Order is CANCELLED and refund is REFUNDED or REFUND_PENDING
end note
@enduml
